    "summary": "<p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/datasette/releases/tag/0.65.6\">datasette 0.65.6</a></p> <p>I backported a minor security fix from 1.0a43:</p> <blockquote> <p>Fixed a security issue where a database registered using <code>add_database(db, name=..., route=...)</code> with a route that differs from its name could be downloaded from <code>/<route>.db</code> by actors who were denied access to it. [...]</p> </blockquote> <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags",
    "body": "<p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/datasette/releases/tag/0.65.6\">datasette 0.65.6</a></p> <p>I backported a minor security fix from 1.0a43:</p> <blockquote> <p>Fixed a security issue where a database registered using <code>add_database(db, name=..., route=...)</code> with a route that differs from its name could be downloaded from <code>/<route>.db</code> by actors who were denied access to it. [...]</p> </blockquote> <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/security\">security</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/datasette\">datasette</a></p>",
